    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630600/extras/6c556e8d4eabe34efce987b25f32ccce.avif?t=1752807369\" width=160 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630600/extras/d7fe930053b93334a09147e5d127c3e6.avif?t=1752807369\" width=160 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From by is a simple third person action adventure game where players need to transform into various animals, evade danger and improve their skills in an environment full of mechanisms, and ultimately complete the competition to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxed and humorous multiplayer challenge, where you and your friends will transform into animals and joyfully adventure through creative levels. What are you waiting for? Start a happy and hilarious time with your friends!</p>",
